Z||000001||AkursedX||04-15-2001||03:09 PM||||You could probably find a way to make 6x8's to fit in the dash, but I higly doubt you can fit them in the sail panels.  People have put 6x9's in the dash, so I would think the same can be done with 6x8's, but I have no personal experience with doing that||||reg||1
