Z||000003||MoneypitGT||04-15-2001||08:58 PM||||I had put infinity 5x7/6x8's in the dash of my GT. You have to do some modifying but nothing to major. I think they sound better than any 4x10's that are out there, (all two pair that are made.) The easiest way to do it is to take the dash out, it makes getting in there with a dremel a whole lot easier, but you can do it with it in, I have done it twice now.<BR> Chris<P>------------------<BR><B>Check out my site at:</B>   <A HREF="http://www.customdynamix.com" TARGET=_blank>www.customdynamix.com</A> <BR>2 '87 GT Projects||||reg||6
